p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, more often than any other pair. On the middle, 2025 ran 147% of normal in April to May but only 57% in August to September. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 49% on the middle. Grid 19374 had its driest year in 1985 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
